\":\"en-GB\",\"description\":\"British girl child voiceover artist Arabella Harris brings energy, clarity, and charm to commercials, explainer videos, radio, and national campaigns.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2025-06-04T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Arabella Harris – Child Girl Voiceover Artist"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Arabella Harris – Professional UK Girl Child Voiceover Artist</p>\r\n"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>Arabella Harris – British Girl Child Voiceover</h1>\r\n<p>Arabella Harris is a professional British child voiceover artist based in the UK. At just 9 years old, she’s already voiced national radio ads for Tesco, Sainsbury’s, KISS, Asda, Morrisons, Nickelodeon and more. With her natural, confident tone and clear British young girl voice, Arabella brings warmth, charm, and credibility to every script – whether it's for TV, radio, eLearning, or animation.</p>\r\n<p>Looking to cast a talented child voice for your next campaign?<br><a href=\"https://www.arabellaharris.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit her official website</a> or listen to her demos below.</p>\r\n"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XUJm7iRZ8FI","title":"Arabella Harris – Child Girl Voiceover Artist","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/arabella-harris-voiceover-kid.jpg","alt":"Arabella Harris British Girl Child Voiceover Kid","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Projects & Experience:</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Arabella’s voice has featured on UK radio, animated characters, and educational content aimed at children.\r\n<br>\r\nShe’s also the voice of a Penguin attraction in Oman, proving her talent travels well beyond the UK. With clear diction, natural charm, and loves direction, she’s a favourite for fun, youthful reads.\r\n<br>\r\nWhether it’s playful, sincere, or full of excitement, her voice is perfect for capturing the imagination of young audiences, and often makes grown-ups smile too.</p>\r\n"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Related Voice Styles You Might Like</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you're casting a campaign that features children or families, you might also enjoy some of my most popular character voices:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Style\">David Attenborough-style Narration</a> – Great for nature-themed or spoof educational content.</li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Claus Voiceover\">Santa Claus Voice</a> – My festive voice work used by BBC, ITV and Tesco, perfect for Christmas campaigns alongside a child VO.</li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/pathe-news-voice\" title=\"Pathé News Voiceover\">Pathé News Voice Style</a> – Ideal for nostalgic, comedic, or historical reads.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These signature voices have featured in national campaigns, viral videos, and social media stunts, they pair brilliantly with a youthful or family-led tone.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/guy-harris-characters.jpg","alt":"Arabella Harris British Girl Child Voiceover Kid","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2><strong>Want Arabella for Your Next Project?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you’re looking for a talented British girl child voiceover, Arabella is available for bookings through me. For rates and availability, <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a> today!</p>\r\n"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Arabella Harris – Child Girl Voiceover Artist","pageUrl":"arabella-harris-girl-child-voiceover-kid"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","680",{"href":"/voiceover-studio-finder","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/voiceoverstudio-finder.jpg","alt":"Voiceover Studio Finder","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Voiceover Studio Finder "}]]}],["$","$L3","890",{"href":"/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice.jpg","alt":"this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"This Morning Spin 2 Win Gameshow"}]]}],["$","$L3","499",{"href":"/save-water","className":"blog-related-card","children":[[